{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0Step into the adventure with this free DEMO. Explore the first world, conquer 3 challenging levels high above the void, and unlock 2 unique skins. With 15\u201345 minutes of playtime, it\u2019s a taste of the experience awaiting you in the full game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Void Jump VR is a fast-paced, first-person VR platformer set in a neon-lit, dystopian future where every step could be your last.\u00a0Step onto floating platforms high above the abyss in this VR sci-fi adventure. Test your courage, master precision jumps, and overcome your fear of heights as you race against time to reach the finish. Collect stars, unlock new worlds, and customize your look with unique skins.<br>\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/b0bf55464532de6a12a6a6472747ecea.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/b0bf55464532de6a12a6a6472747ecea.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/b0bf55464532de6a12a6a6472747ecea.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step counts. Navigate across disappearing platforms, make daring leaps, and choose between safe paths or risky shortcuts. The higher the risk, the greater the reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/399b89144f5cb11d63774956dc5be7f6.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/399b89144f5cb11d63774956dc5be7f6.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/399b89144f5cb11d63774956dc5be7f6.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/252dade2e7dd538b77ea137974bfee6b.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/252dade2e7dd538b77ea137974bfee6b.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/252dade2e7dd538b77ea137974bfee6b.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Time to your advantage - freeze the world and leap without fear. Gather Shields to reveal which platforms will hold you - and which are about to fall. Collect stars to unlock new levels, worlds, and skins.\u00a0Become not only a skilled player but a stylish one too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/f3909926ad7d2237e573135718ea410f.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/f3909926ad7d2237e573135718ea410f.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/f3909926ad7d2237e573135718ea410f.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/5a4a3731cf025bff482610ea2e42d099.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/5a4a3731cf025bff482610ea2e42d099.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/5a4a3731cf025bff482610ea2e42d099.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn stars to unlock a variety of unique VR skins. Show off your style while conquering the heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/a29ef0a7ed817caed9ab52aef1b4e099.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/a29ef0a7ed817caed9ab52aef1b4e099.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/a29ef0a7ed817caed9ab52aef1b4e099.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure if the next platform will hold? Use Pickups - throw a cube ahead and test its stability before you leap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2f0490e59a2bb98241a6161bbfea8ed2.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2f0490e59a2bb98241a6161bbfea8ed2.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2f0490e59a2bb98241a6161bbfea8ed2.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the finish, press the button, and see your results: stars earned, completion time, and your personal best. Every level is a new challenge, every finish a victory - can you conquer them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997820?t=1757755284","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/effc90d900468e3c350e714b6388ee84896c42ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757755284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/abbdb6f750ae875a407863d43bb7418bb99a720f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757755284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/abbdb6f750ae875a407863d43bb7418bb99a720f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757755284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0Step into the adventure with this free DEMO. Explore the first world, conquer 3 challenging levels high above the void, and unlock 2 unique skins. With 15\u201345 minutes of playtime, it\u2019s a taste of the experience awaiting you in the full game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Void Jump VR is a fast-paced, first-person VR platformer set in a neon-lit, dystopian future where every step could be your last.\u00a0Step onto floating platforms high above the abyss in this VR sci-fi adventure. Test your courage, master precision jumps, and overcome your fear of heights as you race against time to reach the finish. Collect stars, unlock new worlds, and customize your look with unique skins.<br>\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/b0bf55464532de6a12a6a6472747ecea.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/b0bf55464532de6a12a6a6472747ecea.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/b0bf55464532de6a12a6a6472747ecea.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step counts. Navigate across disappearing platforms, make daring leaps, and choose between safe paths or risky shortcuts. The higher the risk, the greater the reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/399b89144f5cb11d63774956dc5be7f6.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/399b89144f5cb11d63774956dc5be7f6.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/399b89144f5cb11d63774956dc5be7f6.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/252dade2e7dd538b77ea137974bfee6b.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/252dade2e7dd538b77ea137974bfee6b.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/252dade2e7dd538b77ea137974bfee6b.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Time to your advantage - freeze the world and leap without fear. Gather Shields to reveal which platforms will hold you - and which are about to fall. Collect stars to unlock new levels, worlds, and skins.\u00a0Become not only a skilled player but a stylish one too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/f3909926ad7d2237e573135718ea410f.poster.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/f3909926ad7d2237e573135718ea410f.webm?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/f3909926ad7d2237e573135718ea410f.mp4?t=1757755284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997820/extras/2ec39809f4251d77e04ff68df47dca76.avif?t=1757755284\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img